# Level 5: The Neurotoxin Annex
# Follow the alternating ladders to the emergency shutoff, then return to the
# entrance after the safety interlock opens the exit door.
script neurotoxin_maze
playerStart 92 790

# Enclosed annex shell and four walkable tiers. Each intermediate floor leaves
# one opening around its ladder, producing a long switchback route while also
# giving the buoyant gas a visible path upward through the maze.
solid 0 0 1600 32
solid 0 32 32 818
solid 1568 32 32 818
solid 0 850 1600 50

# Lower-to-first-tier opening on the right.
solid 32 650 1388 32
solid 1510 650 58 32
ladder 1440 625 48 225

# First-to-second-tier opening on the left.
solid 32 450 68 32
solid 190 450 1378 32
ladder 120 425 48 225

# Second-to-top-tier opening on the right.
solid 32 250 1388 32
solid 1510 250 58 32
ladder 1440 225 48 225

# Alternating low barricades and overhead baffles turn each long corridor into
# readable maze beats without requiring a crouch mechanic.
solid 430 782 54 68
solid 735 682 42 92
solid 1030 798 58 52
solid 1260 682 42 94

solid 1190 582 58 68
solid 910 482 42 94
solid 630 596 58 54
solid 350 482 42 96

solid 370 382 58 68
solid 660 282 42 94
solid 960 396 58 54
solid 1230 282 42 96

solid 1180 182 58 68
solid 890 32 42 124
solid 610 196 58 54
solid 330 32 42 126

# Annex security robots patrol distinct stretches of the switchback. Their
# routes stop short of the entrance, valve, exit, ladders, and barricades.
enemy 540 810 34 40 500 720 58
enemy 760 610 34 40 700 900 64
enemy 1320 610 34 40 1260 1410 58
enemy 1080 410 34 40 1025 1210 62
enemy 720 210 34 40 680 860 55

# A reusable safety mask: it makes the gas traversable, but enemy contact
# knocks it off and consumes the protection.
gasMask 520 220 14

# The sealed exit is deliberately next to the leak and starting position. The
# player sees the goal immediately, then has to traverse the whole annex.
# The eight-pixel frame fits exactly between the tier underside at y=682 and
# the foundation at y=850, so neither edge intersects the surrounding masonry.
exit 64 690 82 160
valve 120 207 35

# Smoke seeps steadily from the ruptured lower pipe. Exposure rate is tuned so
# brief contact is survivable while lingering in a dense cloud is fatal.
gas 32 32 1536 818 20 0 1.25
toxinLeak 0 260 816 55 2200 0.030
